From b3650f7a3a1ecf6ec2f0f0da18abb0df859f4ae1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ekaunt <ekaunt@maany.cloud>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 19:09:12 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 1/6] Tron shaders: frame clock, animated primitives, window
 rez-in

Adds a time uniform to primitive and texture shaders and an fx_age
uniform (seconds since a view was first drawn) to texture shaders.
Primitives named tron_* redraw on a timer at anim_fps (new config key,
default 60), and views redraw while their rez-in runs.

New shaders: tron_grid (animated perspective grid background),
tron_border (glowing focus border with racing streaks) and the tron
texture set (rez-in scan on window open).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
